# A wand of kick (a small wand, 106, with kick: an offensive skill, not a spell) zapped at a fido (3062), which
# isn't safe: "That's not a spell!", and then the fido fights back (fight.c's check_killer and multi_hit), one
# round each time, as only area_update runs. In the temple (3001): Pickpocket (13, wands at 75%). Five charges, as the rolls can fail.
@connect pick
Pickpocket
psswrd
@return
@return
@mob 3062 3001
@obj 106 3001 5 5 5 116 0
get wand
hold wand
zap fido
@pulse 24
zap fido
@pulse 24
zap fido
@pulse 24
zap fido
@pulse 24
zap fido
